kc-development-tools development data
-------------------------------------

The bundled equipment-development snapshot is derived from the fixed commit
`d065120` of SkywalkerJi/kc-development-tools:
https://github.com/SkywalkerJi/kc-development-tools

The upstream author granted the project maintainer permission to use the
relevant data and calculation behavior, with the express condition that the
upstream user interface not be copied. Yahagi uses an independently designed
command-dashboard interface and an independent Dart implementation. It does
not bundle the upstream Vue components, CSS, images, or page layout.

The snapshot records the source repository, commit, and SHA-256 hashes. Pool
name translations included in the upstream dataset remain attributed to the
upstream contributors and their noted KC3-derived naming references. Game
names and master-data identifiers remain the property of their respective
owners. Development probabilities may lag behind game changes; actual game
behavior takes precedence.
